{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">OVERVIEW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overhours is a satirical action-tower defense game set in a fictional agency facing an invasion of soul-eating monsters. Work the night owl shift and face the hordes with a variety of traps and special abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/extras/OH_LibraryHero_tiny.png?t=1738979351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to work and play\u00a0<i>over-hours</i>\u00a0(yes, we had to) at one of the top-ranked agencies in the world? Check the boxes below to see if you fit the bill for our immediate vacancies:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2611 <i>DEFEND AND FIGHT AGAINST A MONSTER INVASION</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHIFT has been ranked as one of the best agencies in the world, but we obviously can\u2019t function if we\u2019re being attacked?! There\u2019s also no better way to prove your dedication to your job than to shoot, skewer, or burn some gnarly soul-eating beasts!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/extras/steam_trap_and_shooting.gif?t=1738979351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2611<i> RESOURCEFUL: UNLOCK AND UPGRADE</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SHIFT employees think fast, and use whatever tools (traps and towers) they\u2019re given to strategize their path to success. Every level is a new challenge, and there are plenty of upgrades and special abilities to discover. Whatever you do, DON\u2019T let the hordes through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/extras/steam_newtrap.gif?t=1738979351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2611 <i>STRATEGIC, PERFECTIONIST, LOVES BONUSES</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Practice makes perfect, and we encourage you to do your job PERFECTLY! Eradicate all monsters in each level with the highest rating for better bonuses. Replay levels with different defenses to find your perfect strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/extras/steam_score.gif?t=1738979351\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2611 <i>LOVES FRIENDS</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be friendly, or don\u2019t, that\u2019s up to you. Clearly we\u2019re all animals here, but not all of us bite (except Dave, he\u2019s just a bit anxious). Get to know the rest of your colleagues and learn their stories! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/extras/Cafeteria_Characters_616.png?t=1738979351\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2439500?t=1738979351","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738979351","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/616970acde7cb8f1b161e17a1ad1756170e05d07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1738979351","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439500/616970acde7cb8f1b161e17a1ad1756170e05d07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1738979351","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","